  "install_blocks": [
    {
      "lang": "text",
      "code": "请帮我把开源电视桌面 Aerial 装到我的电视上，并设为开机进入的桌面。\n电视 IP：<电视IP>\n保持 ADB 常开：要\n\n安装说明在这里：https://aerial.qust.me/agent.md\n（打不开时用 https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pengchujin/aerial-tv/main/site/agent.md ）\n\n请先完整读完安装说明再动手，然后在我的电脑上亲自运行命令，不要只把步骤告诉我。需要我在电视上操作时提醒我。\n最后按说明里的「验收」，把这几条命令的原始输出原样贴给我：\n- adb shell \"cmd package resolve-activity --brief -a android.intent.action.MAIN -c android.intent.category.HOME\"\n- adb shell settings get secure enabled_accessibility_services\n- 按主页键后的 adb shell \"dumpsys window | grep mCurrentFocus\""
    },
    {
      "lang": "bash",
      "code": "curl -fsSL https://aerial.qust.me/install.sh | KEEP_ADB=1 TV=192.168.1.20 bash"
    },
    {
      "lang": "bash",
      "code": "adb connect 192.168.1.20:5555\nadb install -r aerial-standard.apk\nadb shell pm grant app.orchard.tv android.permission.WRITE_SECURE_SETTINGS\nadb shell cmd notification allow_listener app.orchard.tv/app.orchard.tv.guard.RevivalListener\nadb shell appops set app.orchard.tv SYSTEM_ALERT_WINDOW allow\nadb shell am start -n app.orchard.tv/.MainActivity"
    },
    {
      "lang": "bash",
      "code": "curl -fsSL https://aerial.qust.me/install.sh | TV=192.168.1.20 bash -s restore"
    }
  ],
